<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/1/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "For the avoidance of any doubt, it is hereby declared that no proceedings whatsoever shall be brought in any court against the Yang di-Pertuan Agong or the Ruler of a State in his personal capacity in respect of anything done or omitted to be done by him betore the coming"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/1/eng@> .
